              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, javelins, and shield. May take throwing spear (+1 pt), or bow (+1 pt) instead of javelins. Deployment options: may either place Stakes (+20 pts per unit), or have Camels (+10 pts per unit). Formed Volunteers: Open Order, Warband; either Stakes or Camels. (Armies of Chivalry p.53)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="b23b-0811-4714-e26c" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">6+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <!-- armour-save -->
