            <profile id="0fe4-42c7-18b0-6317" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Volunteers may be designated as Skirmishers (free). Skirmishers may take either sling (free), or bow (+1 pt) instead of javelins. 0-2 Skirmisher units may take crossbow (+4 pts), or handgun (+4 pts) instead of javelins. Volunteer Skirmisher models with handguns and crossbows may not outnumber Volunteer Skirmisher models with other weapons. Handguns are not available in Ghazi armies. (Armies of Chivalry p.53)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="a332-012b-e8cb-d3b4" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">6+</characteristic>
