            <profile id="3fb4-8642-3aad-d9cf" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Each gun has a crew of three; two additional crew may be added (+10 pts each). Crewmen have hand weapon and light armour and may upgrade to heavy armour (+2 pts). Light artillery range 36", Strength 6. Artillery: up to one gun for every 1,000 army points (bought from the Infantry allocation). Conquest Ottoman artillery: Master Gunners (+20 pts per cannon) and frontal plates (+10 pts per cannon) may be added (documented only); the artillery may be placed in the 3" intervals between the Tabor wagons. (Armies of Chivalry p.53)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="e1a3-fc86-7b74-5fa6" name="Artillery (Chivalry)" hidden="false" targetId="dfeb-8f7d-cb3d-409f" type="rule"/>
